"High accuracy is enough".
All-majority also has 98.0%;
look at recall and precision.

lec05kp26-u01-p9-nf-lec05-kp26-compare-4.text:
specificity = share of majority points right, TN/5000.
balanced accuracy = (recall + specificity)/2;
all-majority gives $(0+1)/2=0.50$.
